OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMigrants taken to Dover after more
OL,4,Athan 30 hours at sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boat left the Normandy coast on
OL,7,FMonday morning and the French
OL,8,Fcoastguard, which shadowed it, said the
OL,9,Fmigrants were in "precarious
OL,10,Fconditions" and refused help as they
OL,11,Fwere "determined to take all risks to
OL,12,Freach" the UK.
OL,14,FBritish rescue boats were sent to
OL,15,Fcollect those on board, who were then
OL,16,Ftransferred to Border Security Command.
